{"id":"n62466-1-17","stage":1,"title":"직원 · 职员","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62466-1-17-1","ko":"애프터서비스를 받으려고 찾아왔는데요.","zh":"我是来申请售后服务的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"애프터서비스를","meaning":"售后服务","explanation":"애프터서비스：售后服务；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"애프터서비스","audio":"/audio/11e4f59a8c2bd5381f22.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17397","senseId":"1","lemma":"애프터서비스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받으려고","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；으려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아왔는데요.","meaning":"来找，来访，访问","explanation":"찾아오다：来找，来访，访问；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데요：礼貌地交代背景、感想或含蓄的对照。","readings":[{"term":"찾아오다","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60322","senseId":"1","lemma":"찾아오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"11e4f59a8c2bd538","term":"애프터서비스","zh":"售后服务","audio":"/audio/11e4f59a8c2bd5381f22.mp3","entryId":"17397","definition":"当出售的商品发生问题时，提供修理、退货、交换等服务。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"接，接受","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"受到要求、申请、提问、攻击或信号等的作用，或指对这些做出反应。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"367f007054a1f285","term":"찾아오다","zh":"来找，来访，访问","audio":"/audio/367f007054a1f285cf95.mp3","entryId":"60322","definition":"来见某人或做某事。","pronunciation":["차자오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f59488c653e494b31ba.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62466-1-17-2","ko":"담당 직원이 잠시 자리를 비운 것 같으니 잠시만 기다려 주세요.","zh":"负责处理的员工好像暂时不在，麻烦您稍等一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"담당","meaning":"负责人","explanation":"담당：负责人","readings":[{"term":"담당","audio":"/audio/37de7504e7436885b0eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14006","senseId":"2","lemma":"담당","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"직원이","meaning":"职员，职工","explanation":"직원：职员，职工；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"직원","audio":"/audio/680ce6b5107e3b64d049.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62466","senseId":"1","lemma":"직원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠시","meaning":"暂时，一会儿","explanation":"잠시：暂时，一会儿","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26895","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"자리를","meaning":"职，岗位","explanation":"자리：职，岗位；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"자리","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60332","senseId":"5","lemma":"자리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비운","meaning":"不在，离开","explanation":"비우다：不在，离开；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"비우다","audio":"/audio/e1f74ccf9cd9d475004a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15631","senseId":"3","lemma":"비우다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같으니","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잠시만","meaning":"暂时，一会儿","explanation":"잠시：暂时，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"잠시","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26895","senseId":"1","lemma":"잠시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"기다려","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"37de7504e7436885","term":"담당","zh":"负责人","audio":"/audio/37de7504e7436885b0eb.mp3","entryId":"14006","definition":"担负某事的人。","pronunciation":["담당"]},{"id":"680ce6b5107e3b64","term":"직원","zh":"职员，职工","audio":"/audio/680ce6b5107e3b64d049.mp3","entryId":"62466","definition":"归属于一定的工作单位而做事的人。","pronunciation":["지권"]},{"id":"6fcdfa8c124ab5cb","term":"잠시","zh":"暂时，一会儿","audio":"/audio/6fcdfa8c124ab5cbb197.mp3","entryId":"26895","definition":"在很短的时间之内。","pronunciation":["잠ː시"]},{"id":"0f4adfe312e61750","term":"자리","zh":"职，岗位","audio":"/audio/0f4adfe312e61750897c.mp3","entryId":"60332","definition":"工作的地方。","pronunciation":["자리"]},{"id":"e1f74ccf9cd9d475","term":"비우다","zh":"不在，离开","audio":"/audio/e1f74ccf9cd9d475004a.mp3","entryId":"15631","definition":"从自己所负责的职位或职责中暂时脱离出来。","pronunciation":["비우다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b29d2fc0a293b2d8805c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.957,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62466","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":